    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Cha 15, stressful push</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Choose one flair you know to be your signature move. When you hit a creature and apply a flair by gaining one point of stress, you can also apply your signature move. The attack must still be compatible with your signature move and your target must still be a valid target for it.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/braggart#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
